<?jai include("header.jaitml"); ?>
<main>
	<p class="bigger">Hi! My name is Fabian Huber. I am a Game & Graphics Programmer.</p>
	<p>I specialize in <b>Computer Graphics</b> and <b>low-level</b> systems for video games. I studied <b>Games Programming</b> and <b>Normal Programming&trade;</b>. I enjoy reinventing the wheel and am currently working on my game, using a homemade engine.</p>
